        "collapsible_tab_rtDRV9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>We’ve created our KokoCarb Cartridges from activated carbon using the highest-grade coconut shells (CTC 60) to create a dense, porous structure that removes up to 99.99% of parasites, heavy metals, chemicals and other contaminants - without removing the minerals your body needs.</li><li>Traps physical contaminants more than 20 times smaller than jug filters.</li><li>Silver-impregnated to prevent bacteria growth keeping your water safer for longer.</li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the most effective, sustainable and durable filtration on the market.</li></ul>",
            "product_metafield_key": "",
            "image_metafield_key": "",
            "c1": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
