            "heading": "Warranty & Protection",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>We stand behind the quality and craftsmanship of every Phoenix Gravity system.</p><ul><li><strong>Stainless Steel Gravity Filter System:</strong> 10-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.</li><li><strong>Stainless Steel Tap:</strong> 1-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.</li><li><strong>Carbon Filter Cartridge:</strong> 3-month warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.</li></ul><p><strong>Transit Damage?</strong></p><p>If your order arrives damaged, report it within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>, and we’ll provide a free replacement. Our warranty is designed to give you added confidence in the quality, durability, and workmanship of your Phoenix Gravity water filter.</p>",
